{"pageProps":{"page":{"ID":1880,"post_author":"9","post_date":"October 10, 2025","post_date_gmt":"2025-10-10 21:37:12","post_title":"September 2025 Product Release","post_status":"publish","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","post_name":"september-2025-product-release","post_modified":"2025-10-13 15:30:40","post_modified_gmt":"2025-10-13 15:30:40","guid":"https://pylon-two.vercel.app/?p=1880","post_type":"post","filter":"raw","url":"https://pylon-two.vercel.app/resources/september-2025-product-release/","preview_type":"image","content_blocks":[{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This month’s updates include enhanced task tracking, accelerated pricing calculations, faster refis with lien linking control, and a smoother rate lock and disclosure experience.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Each feature improves speed, precision, and visibility across key workflows, helping originators move from application to close with less friction.</span></p>\n"},{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<h2>Enhanced task tracking</h2>\n<p>Task badges now display how long each task has been outstanding, overdue, or how long it took to complete.</p>\n<p>What it means for you:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Clear visibility</strong> into task progress and timing</li>\n<li><strong>Improved accountability</strong> and tasking <strong>auditability</strong></li>\n<li>Better insight into <strong>team performance</strong> and bottlenecks</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"acf_fc_layout":"asset_block","asset":{"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Task-Tracking.png","alt":"Task Tracking","width":1992,"height":1212}}]}},{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<h2>Faster pricing calculations</h2>\n<p>Pre-approvals and product runs are now significantly faster, enabling loan officers to structure and compare scenarios with greater speed and responsiveness.</p>\n<p>What it means for you:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>53% faster</strong> product and pricing results</li>\n<li>More <strong>efficient pre-approval</strong> workflows</li>\n<li><strong>Quicker scenario structuring</strong> and borrower responses</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"acf_fc_layout":"asset_block","asset":{"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Faster-products-pricing.png","alt":"Faster products & pricing","width":1992,"height":1212}}]}},{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<h2>Faster refis with lien linking control</h2>\n<p>Loan officers can now link liabilities from the credit report directly to the subject property, even if borrowers missed this step during the application. This makes it easier to identify existing mortgages and accurately structure refinance scenarios.</p>\n<p>What it means for you:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Self-serve</strong> lien linking</li>\n<li><strong>More accurate refinance</strong> file setup</li>\n<li>Smoother workflows <strong>aligned with refi market momentum</strong></li>\n</ul>\n"},{"acf_fc_layout":"asset_block","asset":{"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Lien-Linking.png","alt":"Lien Linking","width":1992,"height":1212}}]}},{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<h2>Improved rate lock and disclosure experience</h2>\n<p>Disclosures are now created automatically as a task upon rate lock, streamlining the path to rate lock and reducing wait times for disclosure generation.</p>\n<p>What it means for you:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Smoother, <strong>more seamless rate locks</strong></li>\n<li><strong>Faster disclosure experience</strong> after rate lock</li>\n<li><strong>Fewer manual steps</strong> in post-lock workflows</li>\n</ul>\n"},{"acf_fc_layout":"asset_block","asset":{"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Rate-lock.png","alt":"Rate lock","width":1992,"height":1212}}]}},{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<h2>API improvements</h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We’ve refined Pylon’s API to improve reliability, clarity, and transparency across key workflows.</span></p>\n<p><b>Enhanced disclosure tracking: </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">disclosure packages are now displayed in chronological order, and you can view the full history of every disclosure run for better visibility and auditability.</span></p>\n<p><b>Clearer error handling</b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">: Loan officer assignment errors now display specific messages when a license is expired or invalid in a state.</span></p>\n<p><b>Improved loan collaboration: </b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The new contributor API allows multiple participants such as loan officers, wealth advisors, and real estate agents to work together on a single deal, simplifying data entry and borrower task management.</span></p>\n"},{"acf_fc_layout":"text_block","text":"<h2>More news from Pylon</h2>\n<p>» <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/14t0iQHYo1rW3gJrJzxBMM\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Trent discusses the future of mortgage on Chrisman Commentary</span></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">» Pylon is going to MBA Annual 2025 in Las Vegas. Stop by booth 1013 and say hello!</span></p>\n"}],"related_heading":"Keep reading","related_button_label":"Read more","categories":[{"id":16,"name":"Releases","slug":"release-notes"}],"author":{"name":"Brett Byron","acf":{"profile_image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Brett.png","alt":"Brett","width":515,"height":417}}},"seo":{"title":"September 2025 Product Release - Pylon","description":"Pylon’s latest updates deliver faster pricing, better task tracking, smarter lien linking, and a smoother rate lock experience.","image":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/September-Product-Release-1024x623.png"},"featured_image":{"src":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/September-Product-Release.png","width":760,"height":460,"alt":"September Product Release"}},"options":{"menu":{"nav_items":[{"link":{"title":"Platform","url":"/#","target":""},"has_submenu":true,"submenu_type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"grid","grid_links":[{"remove_asset":false,"asset":{"":null,"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/loader.svg","alt":"loader","width":30,"height":30}}],"add_max_width":false,"max_width":""},"link":{"title":"Decisioning","url":"/decisioning","target":""},"description":"Instant credit evaluations"},{"remove_asset":false,"asset":{"":null,"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/list.svg","alt":"list","width":30,"height":30}}],"add_max_width":false,"max_width":""},"link":{"title":"Compliance","url":"/compliance","target":""},"description":"Always-on risk protection"},{"remove_asset":false,"asset":{"":null,"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/user-focus.svg","alt":"user focus","width":30,"height":30}}],"add_max_width":false,"max_width":""},"link":{"title":"Command Center","url":"/command-center","target":""},"description":"Modern loan officer tooling"},{"remove_asset":false,"asset":{"":null,"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/bar-chart.svg","alt":"bar chart","width":30,"height":30}}],"add_max_width":false,"max_width":""},"link":{"title":"Capital","url":"/capital","target":""},"description":"Direct Wall Street rates"},{"remove_asset":false,"asset":{"":null,"type":[{"acf_fc_layout":"image","image":{"url":"https://pylonwp.wpenginepowered.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/square-four.svg","alt":"square four","width":30,"height":30}}],"add_max_width":false,"max_width":""},"link":{"title":"Elements","url":"/eleme